ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260512/202605122312233616_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260512/202605122312233616_720.jpg"> </div><p>【U17男足晋级世少赛】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-13/match1921438date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">进军世少赛！U17国足2-0卡塔尔U17小组出线 何思凡破门张伯霖建功</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260513/zhanbao_image_1921438_1778609900_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260513/zhanbao_image_1921438_1778609900_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260513/zhanbao_image_1921438_1778609900_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>U17亚洲杯第三轮，<span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">U17国足2-0卡塔尔U17，以小组第2出线！同时，U17国足也成功晋级世少赛！</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-13/6a0346f441aeenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">惊险晋级！U17亚洲杯中国队小组出线，时隔21年重返世少赛</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260513/6a0370a1f2fb0.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260513/6a0370a1f2fb0.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260513/6a0370a1f2fb0.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">世少赛于2026年底在卡塔尔开打，中国队上次参加这项赛事还是2005年！</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-13/6a036a5f41257native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">久违了！U17男足进世少赛，男足国字号时隔21年重返世界大赛</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.41" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260513/202605130159485568.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.41" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.41" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260513/202605130159485568_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260513/202605130159485568_720.jpg"> </div><p>这不仅是国少时隔21年重返世少赛，也是男足各级别国字号时隔21年重回世界大赛。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-13/6a036a5a3bc88native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">惊险晋级！积分榜：U17国足和卡塔尔、印尼同分，净胜球优势晋级</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.54" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260513/202605130158551237.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.54" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.54" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260513/202605130158551237_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260513/202605130158551237_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">国足U17和卡塔尔、印尼队同积三分，互赢一场所以比较净胜球，国足U17以净胜球优势来到小组第二，成功晋级。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-13/6a0380c3b592anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">冲击4强！U17国足1/4决赛对手：A组第一沙特，5月16日凌晨1点开球</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.71" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260513/202605130343127701_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.71" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.71" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260513/202605130343127701_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260513/202605130343127701_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">随着U17亚洲杯A组的末轮比赛也全部结束，U17国足的1/4决赛对手已经确定，将是A组第一的沙特队。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-13/6a03a3e352a98native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">属于我们的世界杯！世少赛将于26年11-12月举办，5月21日48队抽签</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260513/202605130628036300_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260513/202605130628036300_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260513/202605130628036300_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">2026国际足联U17男足世界杯官方抽签仪式，将于2026年5月21日在国际足联瑞士苏黎世总部举行。</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">【弗洛伦蒂诺召开发布会】</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-13/6a034713e9019native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">弗洛伦蒂诺完整发布会：将继续竞选|西甲联盟是敌人|媒体造谣皇马</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.79" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260513/202605130138468036_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.79" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.79" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260513/202605130138468036_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260513/202605130138468036_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">北京时间0点，弗洛伦蒂诺召开新闻发布会，接受媒体提问，回答皇马相关的一系列问题。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-13/6a03721dee2e3native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">正面迎击！巴萨官方：正评估弗洛伦蒂诺的言论和指控 将进行回应</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.69" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260513/202605130233006544.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.69" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.69" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260513/202605130233006544_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260513/202605130233006544_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">针对弗洛伦蒂诺发布会中的言论，巴萨官方发表声明。</span></p><p>【比赛战报】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-13/match1784606date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">无缘提前夺冠！胜利1-1遭新月绝平+多赛1场5分领跑 本托脱手送礼</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260513/zhanbao_image_1784606_1778616931_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/i